0..48 Comment "// The simply typed lambda calculus is a theory."
49..51 Comment "//"
52..127 Comment "// Context and type indices classify its terms. Its syntax is a first-order"
128..154 Comment "// model of the signature."
155..157 Comment "//"
158..237 Comment "// Object types, contexts, variables and terms are indexed families. A renaming"
238..284 Comment "// maps variables from one context to another."
285..363 Comment "// The semantic type of an arrow is a Kripke function space. A recursion reads"
364..439 Comment "// the semantic type from the object type. The pathological twin names four"
440..457 Comment "// refused steps."
458..460 Comment "//"
461..476 Comment "// - see: #5032"
